{"seeAlsoSections":[{"title":"Selection, Sorting and Actions","anchor":"Selection-Sorting-and-Actions","generated":true,"identifiers":["doc:\/\/ngtable.Gingham\/documentation\/Gingham\/SelectionAndSorting","doc:\/\/ngtable.Gingham\/documentation\/Gingham\/MenusAndActions","doc:\/\/ngtable.Gingham\/documentation\/Gingham\/EditingCells","doc:\/\/ngtable.Gingham\/documentation\/Gingham\/GHSorting","doc:\/\/ngtable.Gingham\/documentation\/Gingham\/GHCollationKeyProvider","doc:\/\/ngtable.Gingham\/documentation\/Gingham\/GHCollationKeyMaker"]}],"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"major":0,"patch":0},"sections":[],"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/gingham\/ghtextkeys"]}],"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/ngtable.Gingham\/documentation\/Gingham\/GHTextKeys","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/ngtable.Gingham\/documentation\/Gingham"]]},"kind":"symbol","topicSections":[{"title":"Initializers","anchor":"Initializers","generated":true,"identifiers":["doc:\/\/ngtable.Gingham\/documentation\/Gingham\/GHTextKeys\/init()"]},{"title":"Instance Methods","anchor":"Instance-Methods","generated":true,"identifiers":["doc:\/\/ngtable.Gingham\/documentation\/Gingham\/GHTextKeys\/makeKeyMaker(collatorIdentifier:)"]}],"relationshipsSections":[{"kind":"relationships","title":"Conforms To","type":"conformsTo","identifiers":["doc:\/\/ngtable.Gingham\/documentation\/Gingham\/GHCollationKeyProvider","doc:\/\/ngtable.Gingham\/s8SendableP","doc:\/\/ngtable.Gingham\/s16SendableMetatypeP"]}],"metadata":{"role":"symbol","externalID":"s:7Gingham10GHTextKeysV","title":"GHTextKeys","symbolKind":"struct","roleHeading":"Structure","modules":[{"name":"Gingham"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"text":"GHTextKeys","kind":"identifier"}],"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"GHTextKeys"}]},"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Collation keys made by Gingham itself, without ICU: the table’s text sorts"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"use them unless an app sets another provider (or none) in"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/ngtable.Gingham\/documentation\/Gingham\/GHTableView\/collationKeyProvider","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"tokens":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"GHTextKeys"}],"platforms":["macOS"],"languages":["swift"]}]},{"kind":"mentions","mentions":["doc:\/\/ngtable.Gingham\/documentation\/Gingham\/PerformanceAndThreading"]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"type":"heading","text":"Overview","anchor":"overview","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"A key is each character’s place in the collator’s order at the primary"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"strength (letters, not case or accents: the table orders those rows by"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"comparing them), with runs of ASCII digits by their value, so the keys"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"order text like "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"localizedStandardCompare"},{"type":"text","text":". The places are learned from"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Foundation’s own comparison for the collator (once, about 30 ms), for the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"characters of the Latin, Greek and Cyrillic scripts, spaces, punctuation,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"currency signs and full-width forms: a language’s own letters (Swedish"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"å after z, Russian putting Cyrillic first) come with it, and the letters"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"it joins into one (Czech “ch” after “h”, Danish “aa” as “å”, Hungarian"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"“dzs”, Welsh “ng” before “n”). Hebrew, Arabic, Devanagari, Thai, kana,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Han and Hangul letters are learned the first time a sort’s texts have"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"them (a sample of them read first; Han in a few tenths of a second)."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Other characters sort after those by their code point, which may"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"disagree: the table finds any pair out of order and sorts by comparing."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Before it’s used, a collator’s table sorts thousands of texts by key and"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"checks them against Foundation; a collator its keys can’t follow gets"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"none ("},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"nil"},{"type":"text","text":": the table compares, as without a provider). Then a sort"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"compares the neighbors whose order the keys may not settle (characters"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Foundation weighs in ways a key can’t, as Han read by the word in"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Chinese: “重” in “重庆” as “chóng”), and puts back those out of order."}]}]}],"references":{"doc://ngtable.Gingham/documentation/Gingham/PerformanceAndThreading":{"kind":"article","abstract":[{"text":"What the table asks for and when, so it stays fast with large data.","type":"text"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/ngtable.Gingham\/documentation\/Gingham\/PerformanceAndThreading","role":"article","type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/gingham\/performanceandthreading","title":"Performance and Threading"},"doc://ngtable.Gingham/documentation/Gingham/MenusAndActions":{"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Offer your app’s actions in the rows’ context menu, and copy rows to other apps."}],"kind":"article","url":"\/documentation\/gingham\/menusandactions","identifier":"doc:\/\/ngtable.Gingham\/documentation\/Gingham\/MenusAndActions","type":"topic","title":"Menus and Actions","role":"article"},"doc://ngtable.Gingham/documentation/Gingham/GHTextKeys/init()":{"type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/ngtable.Gingham\/documentation\/Gingham\/GHTextKeys\/init()","fragments":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"init"},{"kind":"text","text":"()"}],"url":"\/documentation\/gingham\/ghtextkeys\/init()","title":"init()","kind":"symbol","abstract":[],"role":"symbol"},"doc://ngtable.Gingham/documentation/Gingham/GHTextKeys/makeKeyMaker(collatorIdentifier:)":{"fragments":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"text":"makeKeyMaker","kind":"identifier"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"collatorIdentifier"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"String","preciseIdentifier":"s:SS"},{"kind":"text","text":") -> ("},{"kind":"keyword","text":"any"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"GHCollationKeyMaker","preciseIdentifier":"s:7Gingham19GHCollationKeyMakerP"},{"kind":"text","text":")?"}],"type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/gingham\/ghtextkeys\/makekeymaker(collatoridentifier:)","kind":"symbol","role":"symbol","abstract":[],"title":"makeKeyMaker(collatorIdentifier:)","identifier":"doc:\/\/ngtable.Gingham\/documentation\/Gingham\/GHTextKeys\/makeKeyMaker(collatorIdentifier:)"},"doc://ngtable.Gingham/s8SendableP":{"title":"Swift.Sendable","type":"unresolvable","identifier":"doc:\/\/ngtable.Gingham\/s8SendableP"},"doc://ngtable.Gingham/documentation/Gingham/GHSorting":{"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Sorting rows by the table’s "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"NSSortDescriptor"},{"type":"text","text":"s when the data source works"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"with cell values rather than key-value coded objects."}],"navigatorTitle":[{"text":"GHSorting","kind":"identifier"}],"kind":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/gingham\/ghsorting","identifier":"doc:\/\/ngtable.Gingham\/documentation\/Gingham\/GHSorting","title":"GHSorting","type":"topic","fragments":[{"text":"enum","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"GHSorting","kind":"identifier"}],"role":"symbol"},"doc://ngtable.Gingham/documentation/Gingham/GHCollationKeyProvider":{"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Makes collation keys for the table’s text sorts (see"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"GHTableView.collationKeyProvider"},{"type":"text","text":")."}],"navigatorTitle":[{"text":"GHCollationKeyProvider","kind":"identifier"}],"kind":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/gingham\/ghcollationkeyprovider","identifier":"doc:\/\/ngtable.Gingham\/documentation\/Gingham\/GHCollationKeyProvider","title":"GHCollationKeyProvider","type":"topic","fragments":[{"text":"protocol","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"GHCollationKeyProvider","kind":"identifier"}],"role":"symbol"},"doc://ngtable.Gingham/documentation/Gingham/SelectionAndSorting":{"type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/gingham\/selectionandsorting","kind":"article","role":"article","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Keep the selection on the same records, react to it, and sort when the user"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"clicks a header."}],"title":"Selection and Sorting","identifier":"doc:\/\/ngtable.Gingham\/documentation\/Gingham\/SelectionAndSorting"},"doc://ngtable.Gingham/s16SendableMetatypeP":{"type":"unresolvable","identifier":"doc:\/\/ngtable.Gingham\/s16SendableMetatypeP","title":"Swift.SendableMetatype"},"doc://ngtable.Gingham/documentation/Gingham/GHTableView/collationKeyProvider":{"type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/ngtable.Gingham\/documentation\/Gingham\/GHTableView\/collationKeyProvider","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"var"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"collationKeyProvider"},{"kind":"text","text":": ("},{"kind":"keyword","text":"any"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:7Gingham22GHCollationKeyProviderP","text":"GHCollationKeyProvider"},{"kind":"text","text":")?"}],"url":"\/documentation\/gingham\/ghtableview\/collationkeyprovider","title":"collationKeyProvider","kind":"symbol","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Collation keys for sorting text, which sort a million rows in a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"fraction of the time comparing them takes (see "},{"code":"GHCollationKeyProvider","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":"):"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Gingham’s own ("},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/ngtable.Gingham\/documentation\/Gingham\/GHTextKeys"},{"type":"text","text":", the default:"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"code":"GHTableView.defaultCollationKeyProvider","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":"), or e.g."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"code":"GHBundledICUCollation()","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" from the optional GinghamICU library (it adds"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"about 9 MB per architecture to the app). The order stays"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"code":"localizedStandardCompare","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":"’s: rows with equal keys are compared, and"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"every pair of neighbors is checked. "},{"code":"nil","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" compares text, on all cores."}],"role":"symbol"},"doc://ngtable.Gingham/documentation/Gingham/GHTextKeys":{"kind":"symbol","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Collation keys made by Gingham itself, without ICU: the table’s text sorts"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"use them unless an app sets another provider (or none) in"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/ngtable.Gingham\/documentation\/Gingham\/GHTableView\/collationKeyProvider"},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/ngtable.Gingham\/documentation\/Gingham\/GHTextKeys","role":"symbol","type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/gingham\/ghtextkeys","title":"GHTextKeys","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"GHTextKeys"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"GHTextKeys"}]},"doc://ngtable.Gingham/documentation/Gingham/GHCollationKeyMaker":{"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Makes the collation keys of texts on one thread."}],"navigatorTitle":[{"text":"GHCollationKeyMaker","kind":"identifier"}],"kind":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/gingham\/ghcollationkeymaker","identifier":"doc:\/\/ngtable.Gingham\/documentation\/Gingham\/GHCollationKeyMaker","title":"GHCollationKeyMaker","type":"topic","fragments":[{"text":"protocol","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"GHCollationKeyMaker","kind":"identifier"}],"role":"symbol"},"doc://ngtable.Gingham/documentation/Gingham/EditingCells":{"kind":"article","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Let users move from cell to cell with the keyboard and edit values in place,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"like a spreadsheet."}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/ngtable.Gingham\/documentation\/Gingham\/EditingCells","role":"article","type":"topic","title":"Editing Cells","url":"\/documentation\/gingham\/editingcells"},"doc://ngtable.Gingham/documentation/Gingham":{"title":"Gingham","type":"topic","role":"collection","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A fast table for business data on the Mac, iPad and iPhone: frozen columns,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"column groups, a summary row with formulas, row grouping with subtotals, search and filters, stable"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"selection across reloads, and live updates.","type":"text"}],"url":"\/documentation\/gingham","kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/ngtable.Gingham\/documentation\/Gingham"}}}